== page app ==
## app

A tiny application

### Synopsis

app is a tiny application whose only job is to be documented.

```
app [flags]
```

### Examples

```
  app serve --port 9090
  app config set key value
```

### Options

```
  -c, --config string   config file
  -h, --help            help for app
  -q, --quiet           print nothing
      --version         version for app
```

### SEE ALSO

* [app config](app_config.md)	 - Read and write configuration
* [app serve](app_serve.md)	 - Serve traffic

--
== page app serve ==
## app serve

Serve traffic

### Synopsis

serve listens on a port until it is stopped.

```
app serve [flags]
```

### Examples

```
  app serve --port 9090 --tag a,b
```

### Options

```
  -e, --emit llvm|obj   what to emit (default "llvm")
  -h, --help            help for serve
  -H, --host string     host to bind (default "localhost")
  -p, --port int        port to listen on (default 8080)
      --rate float      requests per second (default 2.5)
  -t, --tag strings     tags to attach (default [a,b])
  -v, --verbose         verbosity, repeat for more
```

### Options inherited from parent commands

```
  -c, --config string   config file
```

### SEE ALSO

* [app](app.md)	 - A tiny application

